
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>DigitalSilk Homepage Design</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .container {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            max-width: 1440px;
            width: 100%;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .left-section {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 60px 50px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            max-width: 50%;
        }

        .left-section h1 {
            font-size: 48px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #2c3e50;
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .features {
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }

        .feature-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            color: #34495e;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .feature-item i {
            color: #3498db;
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-right: 15px;
        }

        .feature-item span {
            text-decoration: none;
            position: relative;
        }

        .feature-item .underline {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0px;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 4px;
            background-color: #3498db;
        }

        .logo-section {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .logo-section .logo-text {
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #34495e;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .logo-section .tagline {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #7f8c8d;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .right-section {
            flex: 1;
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            align-items: flex-end;
            padding-right: 20px;
        }

        .right-section img {
            display: block;
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .desktop-mockup {
            width: 75%;
            transform: translateX(-50px);
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .laptop-mockup {
            width: 45%;
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 10%;
            left: 10%;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .tablet-mockup {
            width: 15%;
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 15%;
            right: 15%;
            z-index: 3;
        }

        .phone-mockup {
            width: 12%;
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 30%;
            right: 5%;
            z-index: 4;
        }

        .mug {
            width: 10%;
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 25%;
            right: 25%;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        .background-elements {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            z-index: -1;
        }

        .background-gradient {
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #eef2f3 50%, #ffffff 50%);
        }

        .blur-background {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background-image: url('https://via.placeholder.com/1920x1080/cccccc/ffffff?text=Blurred+Background'); / Placeholder for blurred background /
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            filter: blur(10px);
            z-index: -1;
        }
    </style>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="left-section">
            <h1>Brand-Specific Homepage Designs</h1>
            <div class="features">
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                    <span>THE AVERAGE USER VISITS<br>UP TO 130 WEBSITES DAILY</span>
                    <span class="underline"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                    <span>38% OF USERS NOTICE A<br>WEBSITE'S LAYOUT AND<br>NAVIGATION</span>
                    <span class="underline"></span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="logo-section">
                <div class="logo-text">DIGITALSILK</div>
                <div class="tagline">We Grow Brands Online</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="right-section">
            <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/1200x800/ffffff/cccccc?text=Desktop+Screen" alt="Desktop Screen" class="desktop-mockup">
            <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/800x600/ffffff/cccccc?text=Laptop+Screen" alt="Laptop Screen" class="laptop-mockup">
            <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/400x300/ffffff/cccccc?text=Tablet+Screen" alt="Tablet Screen" class="tablet-mockup">
            <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/300x200/ffffff/cccccc?text=Phone+Screen" alt="Phone Screen" class="phone-mockup">
            <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150x150/ffffff/cccccc?text=Mug" alt="Mug" class="mug">
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
